			"notes": "We've been working long on this full re-code of the project. Here's the first version of the mod which is playable and contains many cool features:\n\n- Almost fully backported 1.14 Update (Only the honey block is missing) by @JWeinelt \n- Added over 100 new blocks, containing: stripped wood variants, deepslate ores, copper variants and much more\n- Re-worked the texture of the ores\n- Added new enchantments: Quick Charge, Swift Sneak (Beta)\n- Added fully working crossbow\n- Added all amor trims (items + on your amor)\n- Added pottery sherds (no function)\n- Added new spawn eggs\n- Added working candles\n- Added 16 new entities\n- Added wolf variants and wolf armor\n- Added full netherite tool and armor set\n- Added full copper tool and armor set\n- Added 23 new advancements, some of them are fully implemented\n- Added campfire\n- Added copper torch\n- Added swimming to player (only visual, beta)\n- Added new world type: Single Biome\n- Added new world type: Modern World (attempt to bring modern world generation into 1.12.2)\n- Added structure: pillager outpost\n- Added structures: new village houses (2 houses generating randomly)\n- HIGHLIGHT: Added command suggestion UI\n\nFixed various bugs aswell. Please note that this mod is not complete. Features may changed and added.\n\nContributors: @ElF1ni, @michaelmawick \n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Important notice: From now on, PathFinder API is required to run this mod."
		}
